#ASSERT `What is the most I can be fined for not giving the coroner information` `as someone else who knows` TRUE EQUALS amount 1000

§§ `The family and anyone else who knows: the inquest and the record`

-- s 24(1): any person may ask, in writing with reasons, where the coroner has jurisdiction (a reportable death).
#ASSERT `May I ask the coroner to hold an inquest` `as family` `in WA, body here` TRUE `another limb` `no exception` TRUE EQUALS yes
#ASSERT `May I ask the coroner to hold an inquest` `as family` `in WA, body here` TRUE `another limb` `no exception` FALSE EQUALS no
#ASSERT `May I ask the coroner to hold an inquest` `as family` `in WA, body here` TRUE `nothing of these` `no exception` TRUE EQUALS no
#ASSERT `May I ask the coroner to hold an inquest` `as family` `in WA, body here` FALSE `nothing of these` `no exception` TRUE EQUALS `yes if` (`May I ask for an inquest` `Graham, uncertified` TRUE)
#ASSERT `May I ask the coroner to hold an inquest` `as someone else who knows` `in WA, body here` FALSE `held in care` `no exception` TRUE EQUALS yes

-- s 24(2): within 7 days of notice of refusal, or after 3 months with no reply.
#ASSERT `May I now apply to the Supreme Court for an order that an inquest be held` `as family` TRUE TRUE 7 TRUE 0 EQUALS yes
#ASSERT `May I now apply to the Supreme Court for an order that an inquest be held` `as family` TRUE TRUE 8 TRUE 0 EQUALS no
#ASSERT `May I now apply to the Supreme Court for an order that an inquest be held` `as family` TRUE FALSE 0 FALSE 3 EQUALS `yes if` (`May I apply to the Supreme Court for an inquest` FALSE 0 FALSE 3)
#ASSERT `May I now apply to the Supreme Court for an order that an inquest be held` `as someone else who knows` TRUE FALSE 0 FALSE 3 EQUALS yes
#ASSERT `May I now apply to the Supreme Court for an order that an inquest be held` `as someone else who knows` TRUE FALSE 0 FALSE 2 EQUALS no

-- s 44, reg 17.
#ASSERT `May I take part in the inquest as an interested person` `as family` `Sue` FALSE EQUALS `interested person` `yes: on the prescribed list as spouse, de facto partner, child, parent or personal representative (reg 17(a))`
#ASSERT `May I take part in the inquest as an interested person` `as family` `a son of sixteen` FALSE EQUALS `interested person` `yes: on the prescribed list as spouse, de facto partner, child, parent or personal representative (reg 17(a))`
#ASSERT `May I take part in the inquest as an interested person` `as family` `the friend` FALSE EQUALS `interested person` (`Am I an interested person at the inquest` `the friend` FALSE)
