#ASSERT `Must the coroner tell me about the body, the post mortem and my rights` `as family` (`Am I one of the next of kin` `a son of sixteen`) `in WA, body here` TRUE `care or police` `no exception` EQUALS `yes if` (`Must the coroner give me the section 20 information` `a son of sixteen` `police action, certified, also injured and unexpected`)
