-- ASSUMEd inputs: reading any of them stops the evaluation, so a case that passes with them shows they were not read.
ASSUME `an unasked fact` IS A BOOLEAN
ASSUME `an unasked number` IS A NUMBER
ASSUME `an unasked Death` IS A Death
ASSUME `an unasked place` IS A `Where the death was`
ASSUME `an unasked appearance` IS A `How the death appears`
ASSUME `an unasked exception` IS A `Abortion or assisted dying`
ASSUME `an unasked direction` IS A Direction
ASSUME `an unasked Directions` IS A Directions
ASSUME `an unasked Kin` IS A Kin
ASSUME `an unasked Request by anyone for a post mortem` IS A `Request by anyone for a post mortem`

